      "config": {
        "title": "Third Person: He, She, It",
        "conceptId": "intro",
        "content": "When talking about ONE other person or thing, we use He, She, or It.\n\n- He = Vah / Wo (Male)\n- She = Vah / Wo (Female)\n- It = Yah / Wo (Thing or Animal)\n\nIMPORTANT: When using He, She, or It, we add 's' or 'es' to the verb!\nExample:\nI play -> He plays.",
        "example": "Let's see the 's' rule in action."
      }
    },
